   "summary": "At RISD, teaching is practice-based and studio-focused, where faculty members guide students through hands-on making, critical dialogue, and conceptual experimentation. Faculty are active artists and designers who mentor students in disciplined research, interdisciplinary collaboration, and real-world problem solving.",
